WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; DUDE, YOU'RE GOING TO LOVE
THIS GAME.

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
ARE THE GRAPHICS AS INSANE AS
EVERYBODY SAYS THEY ARE?

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU KIDDING ME?
"EARTH WAR 3."

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:08.742
IT MAKES "EARTH WAR 2" LOOK LIKE
A MARIO GAME.

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:10.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND IN V.R., FORGET ABOUT IT.
&gt;&gt; DOPE.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:20.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
LET'S SMOKE SOME ZOMBIES.
&gt;&gt; YO, IT'S LIKE I'M ACTUALLY

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:22.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
THERE.
&gt;&gt; RIGHT?

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:25.759
&gt;&gt; HEY, YOU MUST BE THE NEW
SPECIAL DIVISIONS AGENT.

00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:28.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'M DAMIEN.
I RUN THE SAFE HOUSE WHERE YOU

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
CAN UPGRADE GEAR AND CHECK
PROGRESS.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
BUT FIRST, FIND THE WEAPONS
ROOM.

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:34.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH, WOW.
ALL RIGHT.

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:35.335
I'M GOING TO GET THE BIGGEST GUN
THEY HAVE.

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:38.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; DO IT, DUDE.
&gt;&gt; HEY, AGENT.

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:40.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'M ETHAN.
I RUN THE SAFE HOUSE WITH

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.044 align:start size:94% position:6%
DAMIEN.
THIS IS YOUR MISSION HUB.

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:46.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
OR IT WILL BE ONCE I GET IT UP
AND RUNNING.

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:47.447 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT.
UH, COOL.

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:49.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
NOT HERE TO TALK.
WHERE ARE THE GUNS AT?

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:52.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HEY.
IT'S ME, DAMIEN.

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:56.189
I SAW YOU TALKING TO ETHAN.
I HEARD HIM SAY WE RUN THE SAFE

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:57.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
HOUSE TOGETHER.
WE DON'T.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:02.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
I RUN IT.
HE HELPS.

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:06.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT.
&gt;&gt; ETHAN'S NICE

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:09.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
BUT HIS IDEAS AREN'T GREAT.
LIKE HIS MISSION HUB.

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:12.005
&gt;&gt; I JUST WANT TO SHOOT ZOMBIES
AND STUFF BUT THESE HELPER GUYS

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:14.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
KEEP, LIKE, BENDING MY EAR.
&gt;&gt; THE NPCs?

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:17.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
IF YOU DON'T WANT TO TALK TO
THEM, JUST HIT "B," DUDE.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.145
&gt;&gt; HEY, I HEARD SOMETHING WEIRD
ABOUT ETHAN.

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:21.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SKIP.
&gt;&gt; I GET IT.

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:25.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU'RE A BUSY MAN.
NOW GO KICK SOME ASS.

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:28.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; AGENTS, THERE'S A ZOMBIE
HORDE IN SECTOR 3.

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:30.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
COME WITH ME TO GEAR UP.
&gt;&gt; FINALLY.

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:36.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
THANK YOU.
&gt;&gt; HEY.

00:01:36.296 --> 00:01:38.498
I LIED ABOUT THE WHOLE ZOMBIE
HORDE THING SO WE CAN TALK

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:41.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
