&gt;&gt; NO!

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:45.472
&gt;&gt; IS DAMIEN, LIKE, MAD AT ME?
&gt;&gt; I THINK HE'S JEALOUS OF THE

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:48.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
MISSION HUB BECAUSE IT WAS MY
IDEA.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:57.183 align:start size:94% position:6%
OR IT'S SOMETHING ELSE.
WHAT DO YOU THINK?

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SHUT UP.
&gt;&gt; OH, I UNDERSTAND.

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:01.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU DON'T HAVE TIME TO TALK.
BUT LET ME GUESS.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:06.526
YOU HAVE TIME TO TALK TO DAMIEN.
THIS PLACE IS SO TOXIC.

00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:16.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU KIDDING ME?
&gt;&gt; OH, MY GOD.

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:19.672
WHAT WASN'T ALL THAT ABOUT?
&gt;&gt; CAN I KILL THESE GUYS?

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:21.174 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WATCH IT.
OUCH.

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:23.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
BE CAREFUL.
WATCH IT.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:27.547
&gt;&gt; SKIP.
&gt;&gt; I GET IT, YOU'RE A BUSY MAN.

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:31.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
GO KICK SOME ASS.
&gt;&gt; GUNS, NOW, PLEASE!

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:33.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; AGENT.
THERE YOU ARE.

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:37.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'M KNOX, SECTION COMMANDER.
I'LL CUT TO THE CHASE.

00:02:37.757 --> 00:02:40.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
WHAT'S GOING ON WITH ETHAN AND
DAMIEN?

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
GET REAL WITH THE BITCH.
&gt;&gt; NO!

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:46.232
&gt;&gt; WE'LL TALK LATER.
ANYWAY, THE WEAPONS STORAGE ROOM

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:48.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
IS THAT WAY.
GOOD LUCK.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:50.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH, MY GOD.
FINALLY.

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:52.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HEY, AGENT.
DAMIEN AND I ARE HASHING SOME

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:54.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
STUFF OUT.
&gt;&gt; NO!

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:56.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YEAH, WE'RE GOING TO NEED A
MINUTE.

00:02:56.209 --> 00:03:02.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
ALONE.
&gt;&gt; STORAGE ROOM LOCKED.

00:03:02.115 --> 00:03:06.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU KIDDING ME?
&gt;&gt; ANY IDEA THAT'S NOT YOURS.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.922 size:84% position:42%
I MEAN, EVERY TIME NOW.
ETHAN, FOR GOD'S SAKE.

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:15.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SCREW IT, I'M GOING OUT
WITHOUT A GUN.

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:21.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; LAB DOOR OPEN.
&gt;&gt; WHAT'S THE DEAL WITH ETHAN

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:23.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND DAMIEN?
&gt;&gt; NO!

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:26.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; GAME OVER.

